    Half-Life: <s>2,000\r\n    years</s> 24,000 years\r\n\r\n\r\n    Further investigation
    is commencing to optimise\r\n    target to minimise collateral, but we maintain
    the position that this will be\r\n    a remarkably effective weapon to protect
    our way of life"
